Write the `usage-profile` slot.

Intent: two to four sentences on the shape of the window -- how the activity distributed across the
calendar, how much of the window was active, and what that says about how the work ran. The
by-day charts and the outlier-session table follow you in the document, so introduce the shape
rather than reading the series out.

State facts about distribution. No trend verdicts ("usage is improving"), no predictions about
what happens after the window, and nothing about a reporting cadence: whether this report recurs is
not something you know.
